GUACHAT 2G4 XiaoZhi port

This repository is derived from xiaozhi-esp32:
https://github.com/78/xiaozhi-esp32

Upstream snapshot used for this port:
- Version: 2.4.2
- Commit: bb9122ab08c3083eeb4f67b3974b7afe771723b8

The upstream project is licensed under the MIT License. The original license
and copyright notice are preserved in LICENSE.

Board-specific modifications include the guachat board identity (type
"guachat", ESP32-S3), the ST7796 320x480 SPI panel with BGR element order,
inverted colour and PSRAM full-frame buffers, a bare I2S audio path
(MAX98357 amplifier and I2S microphone, no codec chip), ST7796 and FT6336U
resets driven through a TCA9535 IO expander along with the power latch and
the volume keys, FT6336U touch gestures, DRV2605L haptics, MAX17055 fuel
gauge decoding, and single-board repository/CI packaging.
